ttp://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.743ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 750.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">A</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E12-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> also has an eigenvector <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.342ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 578 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">\\overline{\\mathbb v}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-76\" d=\"M338 431Q344 429 422 429Q479 429 503 431H508V385H497Q439 381 423 345Q421 341 356 172T288 -2Q283 -11 263 -11Q244 -11 239 -2Q99 359 98 364Q93 378 82 381T43 385H19V431H25L33 430Q41 430 53 430T79 430T104 429T122 428Q217 428 232 431H240V385H226Q187 384 184 370Q184 366 235 234L286 102L377 341V349Q377 363 367 372T349 383T335 385H331V431H338Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-AF\" d=\"M69 544V590H430V544H69Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-76\" x=\"24\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,248)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(251.80616067637627,0) scale(0.07039298535784125,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"316\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> with eigenvalue <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.117ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1150.1 911.5 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\">\\overline{\\lambda}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMATHI-3BB\" d=\"M166 673Q166 685 183 694H202Q292 691 316 644Q322 629 373 486T474 207T524 67Q531 47 537 34T546 15T551 6T555 2T556 -2T550 -11H482Q457 3 450 18T399 152L354 277L340 262Q327 246 293 207T236 141Q211 112 174 69Q123 9 111 -1T83 -12Q47 -12 47 20Q47 37 61 52T199 187Q229 216 266 252T321 306L338 322Q338 323 288 462T234 612Q214 657 183 657Q166 657 166 673Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-AF\" d=\"M69 544V590H430V544H69Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E14-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-3BB\" x=\"24\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,511)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(241.21