\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMATHI-3BB\" x=\"24\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,511)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(241.2175180170965,0) scale(0.2858548854423848,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"394\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(1967,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAINB-76\" x=\"24\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,261)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(236.59701940213805,0) scale(0.3798746236610947,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"428\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E19-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2624\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>But since <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.743ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 750.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-20-Title\">A</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E20-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E20-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a matrix with real entries, we have that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.346ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1150.1 3163.1 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-21-Title\">\\overline{A} = A.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E21-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E21-MJMAIN-AF\" d=\"M69 544V590H430V544H69Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E21-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E21-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"24\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,533)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(209.06654848801062,0) scale(0.940075563880908,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"630\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1077\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMATHI-41\" x=\"2134\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E21-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2884\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> So, we have</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.01ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1150.1 4310 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-22-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-22-Title\">\n\tA\\overline{\\mathbf{v}} = \\overline{\\lambda}\\overline{\\mathbf{v}}.\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E22-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E22-MJMAINB-76\" d=\"M401 444Q413 441 495 441Q568 441 574 444H580V382H510L409 156Q348 18 339 6Q331 -4 320 -4Q318 -4 313 -4T303 -3H288Q273 -3 264 12T221 102Q206 135 197 156L96 382H26V444H34Q49 441 145 441Q252 441 270 444H279V382H231L284 264Q335 149 338 149Q338 150 389 264T442 381Q442 382 418 382H394V444H401Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E22-MJMAIN-AF\" d=\"M69 544V590H430V544H69Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E22-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70